  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 603.01 Incorporation By Reference of Federal Standards. The regulations adopted by the United States Department of Transportation contained in 49 CFR 170-189, the regulations adopted by the Bureau of Motor Carrier Safety, Federal Highway Administration, United States Department of Transportation contained in 49 CFR 382, 49 CFR 385, 49 CFR 390-397, and regulations adopted by the Nuclear Regulatory Commission, United States Department of Energy and contained in 10 CFR 71 and 73 are hereby adopted as a part of these rules.\n\nSource. #1461 eff. 10-16-79; ss by #2249, eff 12-31-82; ss by #2945, eff 1-3-85, EXPIRED: 1-3-91\n\nNew. #5219, eff 9-4-91; ss by #6562, Interim, eff 9-4-97, EXPIRES: 1-2-98; ss by #6615, eff 10-25-97, EXPIRED:10-25-05\n\nNew. #8507, INTERIM, eff 12-7-05, EXPIRED: 6-5-06\n\nNew. #8721-A, eff 9-8-06 (formerly Saf-C 601.03); ss by #12817-A, eff 6-27-19",
